+# Testing Your Next Chapter
+
+## Core idea
+
+Career change becomes clearer through small, deliberate experiments—not prolonged introspection. The visual system turns a dark, looping “thinking” path into a bright field notebook where three real-world tests produce evidence.
+
+## Story arc
+
+1. Challenge the familiar “know yourself first” advice.
+2. Show why action creates information that imagination cannot.
+3. Introduce three experiments: conversation, trial project, and immersion.
+4. Turn each experiment into one focused question.
+5. Close on evidence as progress, even when it changes the direction.
+
+## Visual language
+
+Editorial field notes, route lines, evidence cards, and stamped observations. Navy provides authority, blue signals exploration, and gold marks evidence gained. Motion is purposeful: paths draw, cards settle, and evidence accumulates. No decorative stock imagery is needed.
+
